    "type": "game",
    "name": "Deer Hunting Camp",
    "steam_appid": 3692240,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What could be more exciting than creating your own private spot to deer hunt? And if you want realism,\u00a0this is as close as it gets to actually being in the woods! After you have finished creating, managing,\u00a0and scouting your property you will be challenged with three different stages of hunting season to include;\u00a0early fall bow hunting, late fall black powder hunting, and winter rifle hunting. And the rewards are huge,\u00a0create that ideal whitetail deer habitat and the big bucks will come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATE YOUR OWN HUNTING MAPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This unique concept allows you to design and create your own custom deer hotspot! Many tree, ground cover\u00a0and foliage options are available to craft you map to include; 10 species of trees, 6 species of saplings,\u00a09 types of ground cover, 7 types of foliage, and 6 different terrain types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANAGE &amp; HUNT YOUR PROPERTY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use of one of the four delivered hunting maps, or your custom created maps to create hunting campaigns.\u00a0By planting food plots, placing trail cameras, and deploying tree stands you can prepare yourself for six\u00a0hunting days offered in your campaign. Three different stages of fall can be hunted offering different\u00a0firearms/archery choices and changing deer patterns. Deer sign will also help in patterning and harvesting\u00a0deer which include; deer trails, deer rubs, deer scrapes, and antler sheds.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ACTION MODE &amp; TARGET RANGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action mode is a faster paced hunt designed for increased shooting and situational awareness. Two hunting\u00a0areas offer challenging and different topographies. Any firearm/archery tackle offered in the game may be\u00a0selected which include; 30-06 scoped rifle, 30-30 rifle, 12 gauge pump shotgun, two types of muzzle loading\u00a0riles, crossbow, and compound bow. The target range offers the same firearm/archery tackle options and provides 3D targets and block targets with shooting from either the ground or elevated in a tree stand.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What could be more exciting than creating your own private spot to deer hunt? And if you want realism,\u00a0this is as close as it gets to actually being in the woods! After you have finished creating, managing,\u00a0and scouting your property you will be challenged with three different stages of hunting season to include;\u00a0early fall bow hunting, late fall black powder hunting, and winter rifle hunting. And the rewards are huge,\u00a0create that ideal whitetail deer habitat and the big bucks will come.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CREATE YOUR OWN HUNTING MAPS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This unique concept allows you to design and create your own custom deer hotspot! Many tree, ground cover\u00a0and foliage options are available to craft you map to include; 10 species of trees, 6 species of saplings,\u00a09 types of ground cover, 7 types of foliage, and 6 different terrain types.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANAGE &amp; HUNT YOUR PROPERTY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use of one of the four delivered hunting maps, or your custom created maps to create hunting campaigns.\u00a0By planting food plots, placing trail cameras, and deploying tree stands you can prepare yourself for six\u00a0hunting days offered in your campaign. Three different stages of fall can be hunted offering different\u00a0firearms/archery choices and changing deer patterns. Deer sign will also help in patterning and harvesting\u00a0deer which include; deer trails, deer rubs, deer scrapes, and antler sheds.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ACTION MODE &amp; TARGET RANGE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action mode is a faster paced hunt designed for increased shooting and situational awareness. Two hunting\u00a0areas offer challenging and different topographies. Any firearm/archery tackle offered in the game may be\u00a0selected which include; 30-06 scoped rifle, 30-30 rifle, 12 gauge pump shotgun, two types of muzzle loading\u00a0riles, crossbow, and compound bow. The target range offers the same firearm/archery tackle options and provides 3D targets and block targets with shooting from either the ground or elevated in a tree stand.</p>",
    "short_description": "Deer Hunting Camp allows you to create your own private deer habitat which can be traded with friends! Once done creating, managing, and scouting your property you will be challenged with early fall bow hunting, late fall black powder hunting, and winter rifle hunting.",
